  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound linguine pasta",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "2 cups heavy cream",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "1 cup grated Parmesan cheese",
    "0.33333334326744 cup pesto",
    "1 pound large shrimp, peeled and deveined"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather ingredients together.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zvjS-8m9awSZYq_kqH2hpHEx13s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11808-creamy-pesto-shrimp-ddmfs-Step1-1482-4x3-cf6881d8c7e64ebb90f0c64f2ddefea0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11808/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill a large pot with lightly salted water and bring to a rolling boil. Stir in linguine and return to a boil. Cook pasta uncovered, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, about 8 to 10 minutes; drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TLb4CPtBHbCC5o-nOjTXlNVGopA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11808-creamy-pesto-shrimp-ddmfs-Step2-1545-4x3-9352069c66d24c7a8961293ce3d4e826.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11808/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, melt butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Stir in cream and season with pepper; cook, stirring constantly, for 6 to 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir Parmesan cheese into cream sauce until thoroughly mixed. Stir in pesto and cook until thickened, 3 to 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e3FdJ8PP2CnK84uQI_FZacrLBBI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11808-creamy-pesto-shrimp-ddmfs-Step3-1549-4x3-069b8e8855924cf5b451a4baa47bee5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11808/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in shrimp and cook until they turn pink, about 5 minutes. Serve sauce over hot linguine.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yRBNcfGOYcs5rQ8B_os6_dXoOuA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11808-creamy-pesto-shrimp-ddmfs-Step4-1550-4x3-b44a414b0a034fa69af553ac2bd3679e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11808/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
